inary pediatric rheumatology staff</article-title><source>J Pedatr Psychol</source><year>1995</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>291</fpage><lpage>297</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/jpepsy/20.3.291</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>